		(at 131.0011 92.8036 90)
		(descr "VFQFPN32 5 x 5 x 1.0 mm, 0.5 mm pitch, 3.8 x 3.8 mm exposed pad (IPC-7351 QFN50P500X500X100-33N), its paste split: pads and STEP from the Micras Altium library (MicrasLib); package STSPIN958 DS14341 Rev 1 Table 13 and Figure 25 (recommended land: 0.80 x 0.25 mm pads, 4.06 mm inner span, 3.80 mm pad, no stencil given); this land uses 0.80 x 0.30 mm pads centred 2.5 mm out. Exposed-pad paste in four windows, 51 % of the pad (TI SLUA271C 4.4: 50-70 %), clear of three 0.36 mm lanes at x = -1.45, 0, +1.45 that hold nine thermal-via sites (0.2 mm, on Cmts.User)")
